# =====================================================================
# Git LFS attributes for ac-unreal
# Rationale: UE5 projects accumulate large binary assets (uassets, FBX,
# textures, audio, packaged builds). Storing them in raw git balloons
# the repo and breaks diffs. LFS keeps clones manageable.
# Source code stays in raw git so it diffs/merges normally.
# =====================================================================

# --- Text normalization (UE convention: LF in source, CRLF on Win) ----
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cpp text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
*.cs text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ini text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.uproject text eol=lf
*.uplugin text eol=lf

# --- LFS: UE asset binaries -------------------------------------------
*.uasset filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.umap   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# --- LFS: source art / DCC files --------------------------------------
# NOTE: *.obj intentionally not listed here. .gitignore treats *.obj as
# compiled C++ object output (always ignored). Wavefront .obj source
# meshes are uncommon for UE pipelines (FBX/glTF dominate); if needed,
# add a more specific path-based rule rather than the bare extension.
*.fbx    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.gltf   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.glb    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.dae    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.blend  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.psd    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.tga    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.exr    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.hdr    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.png    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.jpg    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.jpeg   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.tif    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.tiff   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# --- LFS: audio --------------------------------------------------------
*.wav    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.mp3    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.ogg    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.flac   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# --- LFS: video / packaging artifacts ---------------------------------
*.mp4    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.mov    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.zip    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.7z     filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pak    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# --- LFS: trace recordings (parity harness) ---------------------------
# Reference traces from the original client can be large; keep them in LFS.
*.bin    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
harness/traces/**/*.csv filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# --- Intermediate exchange formats (Phase 1 asset-ingest) -------------
# .aclb landblock binaries are small (hundreds of bytes for the v1
# synthetic sample) but they ARE binary. Mark them so git doesn't try
# text conversion / line-ending normalization. Not in LFS yet — sizes
# stay manageable. Revisit if a real-world export pushes individual
# files into MB territory.
*.aclb binary
*.actx binary
